    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "8th term.",
      "worked": "$a=2$, $r=3$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=ar^{n-1}\\\\4374&=2(3)^{n-1}\\\\2187&=3^{n-1}\\\\3^7&=3^{n-1}\\\\n-1&=7\\\\n&=8\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore, $4374$ is the 8th term.",
